{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Restore the man's wife.</b> And do not suppose that perhaps she will be discredited in his eyes and he will not take her back, or that he will hate you and not pray for you." "<b>For he is a prophet.</b> And he knows that you did not touch her — therefore <b>and he will pray for you</b> (Bava Kamma 92b)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:59:36.434030218Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}